It's some kind of a debugger loadable with the CF7 jumper enabled (my  
board developed some fault and doesn't boot from the ROM), I've  
forgotten the details and my floppy developed bad sectors. I have no  
idea where did I download it from.

The contents should look like this:

    49497 May  2  2010 failsafe*
     2295 Sep 24  1999 fwupdate.txt*
   163940 Aug 26  2016 lx164nt.rom*
   466944 Aug 26  2016 lx164srm.rom*
      464 Sep 24  1999 readme.1st*
    80715 Jul 20  1999 relnotes.pdf*
   259868 Jul 20  1999 relnotes.rtf*

-- 
G


